---
const en=Astro.props.lang==='en';
const store=Astro.props.store;
---
<section class="section tracks-section" aria-labelledby="tracks-title"><div class="wrap"><p class="eyebrow eyebrow-blue">{en?'How the project is split':'تقسيم المشروع'}</p><h2 id="tracks-title">{en?'Three activities, each on its own track':'تلات أنشطة، كل واحد في طريقه'}</h2><div class="tracks-grid"><article class="track-card"><span>01</span><h3>{en?'Makeup artist':'خبيرة المكياج'}</h3><p>{en?'Heba’s personal account and her work as a makeup artist.':'حساب هبة الشخصي وشغلها كخبيرة مكياج.'}</p></article><article class="track-card"><span>02</span><h3>{en?'Beauty salon in Libya':'صالون التجميل في ليبيا'}</h3><p>{en?'The salon has its own audience and content, separate from Heba’s personal account.':'الصالون ليه جمهوره ومحتواه، ومنفصل عن حساب هبة الشخصي.'}</p></article><article class="track-card"><span>03</span><h3>{en?'Foundation & store':'الفاونديشن والمتجر'}</h3><p>{en?'I worked on the product content and presentation and built the EasyOrder store. Ads ran when needed.':'اشتغلت على محتوى المنتج وطريقة عرضه، وعملت متجر EasyOrder. والإعلانات كانت بتشتغل حسب الحاجة.'}</p>{store&&<a class="track-link" href={store} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">{en?'Visit the store':'زور المتجر'} ↗</a>}</article></div></div></section>
